  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">전교생 대상으로 진행하는데 간단하게 할 수 있어서 올려봅니다. 올해는 3월 23일(토)입니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1. 어스아워(EarthHour) 란? <span data-ke-size=\"size16\">세계자연기금(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">WWF</span><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">)이 주최하는 환경운동 캠페인으로, 2007년 제1회 행사가 호주 시드니에서 시작된 이래 매년 3월 마지막주 토요일에 실시되고 있다. 해당 일 저녁 8시 30분부터 1시간 전등을 소등함으로써 기후위기와 자연파괴 등 위기에 처한 지구를 위해 행동하는 상징적 자연보전 캠페인&#160;</span></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">2. 어스아워 불끄기 인증 행사 준비물</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">&#160;1) 어스아워 홍보물&#160;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">예시)</span></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c1398a8ac029a309fc68bedfb088934301da382a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c1398a8ac029a309fc68bedfb088934301da382a\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>캔바 사본으로 쓰실 분은 아래 링크로 들어가서 복사하시면 됩니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGhmuBt2PA/tN2-2ooUaPG15C1ceir_JA/edit?utm_content=DAGhmuBt2PA&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=sharebutton\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.canva.com/design/DAGhmuBt2PA/tN2-2ooUaPG15C1ceir_JA/edit?utm_content=DAGhmuBt2PA&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=sharebutton</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;2) QR 설문지</p><p>예시 : 사본으로 보세요. 간단합니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1BbE12a8kaTmPEpRNEW79Ly0qwbok2BZg448rHAqsS-w/edit\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1BbE12a8kaTmPEpRNEW79Ly0qwbok2BZg448rHAqsS-w/copy</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;3) 간식 상품 : 이건 예산에 따라 다양하게 구매 가능합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>3. 행사 진행</p><p>&#160;1) 복도 TV나, 인쇄 게시물로 1주일 전부터 홍보</p><p>&#160;2) 과학 수업 시간마다 들어가서 홍보</p><p>&#160;3) 행사 전날인 3월 21일(금) 아침방송으로 어스아워 관련 홍보 영상 상영</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Huaz2sG3Mk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Huaz2sG3Mk</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Huaz2sG3Mk\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"855\" data-video-height=\"481\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/QCrvn/hyYr2K8QMh/2DbsASnlhUuTcKrFHJHkZ1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/l1T0H/hyYrUfgxPY/nDiP8aZVo4uXcV6mqmt2Lk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"855\" data-video-origin-height=\"481\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1Huaz2sG3Mk\" width=\"855\" height=\"481\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3iLAM6wH6E8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3iLAM6wH6E8</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3iLAM6wH6E8\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"855\" data-video-height=\"481\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/tdQs4/hyYrOF7LN3/gaXNUT7MquzlL2lkgD8yH1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/YkF9t/hyYqVFLF7n/vDJOTOwggD9sZDgxxkVhQK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"855\" data-video-origin-height=\"481\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3iLAM6wH6E8\" width=\"855\" height=\"481\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1bXugo5XbWc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1bXugo5XbWc</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1bXugo5XbWc\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/943sX/hyYr2EoAdf/58dExv8Iz6BaVonYfrpYd0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/IuexC/hyYr4a7Fha/iOhIRZfPrZmE4z2xAkQRY0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1bXugo5XbWc\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>(+시간 가능하면 빛 공해 관련 영상도 좋습니다.)</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u2J6SSkdiXU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u2J6SSkdiXU </a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u2J6SSkdiXU\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"855\" data-video-height=\"481\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cN0cAn/hyYqXjEjxl/KueouPyw7gkQpsr2l1K3HK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dgrWAr/hyYrOzDPWk/hin2uSkSstKF8F6fkKox3K/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"855\" data-video-origin-height=\"481\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/u2J6SSkdiXU\" width=\"855\" height=\"481\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;4) 어스아워 다음주 월요일에 제출된 구글폼 설문지를 보고, 참여한 학생들에게 간식 상품 수여</p><p>&#160;</p><p>4. 예전 후기</p><p>&#160;제가 담임할 때 반 대상으로 했던 인증샷 올려봅니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1cbd44d1f07311799960c55f296d7e4e8fb2a72c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1cbd44d1f07311799960c55f296d7e4e8fb2a72c\" data-origin-width=\"795\" data-origin-height=\"1055\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d576d9f96ea15834299bae9ad9c68bfa2dd468a1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d576d9f96ea15834299bae9ad9c68bfa2dd468a1\" data-origin-width=\"757\" data-origin-height=\"1038\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e85c284ca502c98b92a1903e961bf65ae5a8de68\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e85c284ca502c98b92a1903e961bf65ae5a8de68\" data-origin-width=\"762\" data-origin-height=\"845\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4ebf7691a1c297f54270731e082cc262fe511941\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4ebf7691a1c297f54270731e082cc262fe511941\" data-origin-width=\"774\" data-origin-height=\"572\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0a003d1af24111ed0af